# What goes into the image. Everything else stays in the project folder (nothing is deleted); it is just not
# copied in: .env and other secrets, customer data (data/escalations, data/kb_research), local models (.tools),
# research, chat exports, tests and the dashboard's source and node_modules.
*
!requirements.txt
!config.py
!notifier/
!dashboard/
dashboard/web/
!kb/
!config/
!data/Roster_*.csv
!docker/
!scripts/check_slack.py
**/__pycache__
# Emergent platform build inputs (it uses this same file): its template COPYs backend/, frontend/,
# nginx.conf, entrypoint.sh and pip-cache/, and its entrypoint reads etc/supervisor/conf.d/supervisord.conf.
# Hiding any of them fails the build or makes the container exit on start.
!backend/
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/build/
!nginx.conf
!entrypoint.sh
!pip-cache/
!etc/
